OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAberdeenshire
OL,6,Fmainly cloudy this evening with patchy
OL,7,Frain but the north coast and Moray
OL,8,Fmainly dry. Then becoming dry in the
OL,9,Fearly hours with clear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,12,Fsome sunny spells. A mainly dry
OL,13,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,14,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
