OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBright
OL,6,Fbut showery on Tuesday with strong
OL,7,Fwinds, coastal gales in north. Showers
OL,8,Fdying out on Wednesday with some sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing. Rain spreading from
OL,10,Fwest on Thursday.
